Package: plasma-nm-vpn
Section: metapackages
Architecture: amd64
Depends: plasma-nm-vpn-sb (>= ${pnv:Version}),
         plasma-nm-vpn-xray (>= ${pnv:Version}),
         plasma-nm-vpn-amneziawg (>= ${pnv:Version}),
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: modern VPN protocols for NetworkManager and KDE Plasma (all cores)
 Installs the plugins for all supported cores: Hysteria2, VLESS XHTTP Reality
 and AmneziaWG, configured from the Plasma network settings.

Package: plasma-nm-vpn-common
Architecture: amd64
Depends: network-manager, nftables, pkexec, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: modern VPN protocols for NetworkManager and KDE Plasma (shared files)
 Shared parts of the plasma-nm-vpn plugins: the system user the cores run as
 and the helpers used by the core packages.

Package: plasma-nm-vpn-sb
Architecture: amd64
Depends: plasma-nm-vpn-common (= ${pnv:Version}),
         plasma-nm (>= 4:6.0), plasma-nm (<< 4:7),
         libqt6core6t64 (>= ${qt:BuildVersion}),
         ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Hysteria2 VPN for NetworkManager and KDE Plasma
 NetworkManager VPN plugin and Plasma editor for Hysteria2, using the
 sing-box core (GPL-3.0-or-later; the core is shipped unchanged from its
 upstream release). Supported protocols: Hysteria2.

Package: plasma-nm-vpn-xray
Architecture: amd64
Depends: plasma-nm-vpn-common (= ${pnv:Version}),
         plasma-nm (>= 4:6.0), plasma-nm (<< 4:7),
         ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: VLESS XHTTP Reality VPN for NetworkManager and KDE Plasma
 NetworkManager VPN plugin for VLESS XHTTP Reality, using the Xray core
 (MPL-2.0; shipped unchanged from its upstream release). Supported protocols:
 VLESS XHTTP Reality.

Package: plasma-nm-vpn-amneziawg
Architecture: amd64
Depends: plasma-nm-vpn-common (= ${pnv:Version}),
         plasma-nm (>= 4:6.0), plasma-nm (<< 4:7),
         ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: AmneziaWG VPN for NetworkManager and KDE Plasma
 NetworkManager VPN plugin for AmneziaWG 3.1, using the userspace
 amneziawg-go (MIT) and awg from amneziawg-tools (GPL-2.0). Supported
 protocols: AmneziaWG.

Package: plasma-nm-vpn-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: plasma-nm-vpn repository signing key and apt source
 The key that signs the plasma-nm-vpn apt repository in the GitHub releases,
 and the apt source for it.
